{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-template-js","path":"/CS/ComputerArchitecture/computer_architecture_basics/","result":{"data":{"cur":{"id":"edc448ce-b016-54b8-a810-c48a524c0b14","html":"<h1 id=\"컴퓨터-구조-기초\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%BB%B4%ED%93%A8%ED%84%B0-%EA%B5%AC%EC%A1%B0-%EA%B8%B0%EC%B4%88\" aria-label=\"컴퓨터 구조 기초 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>컴퓨터 구조 기초</h1>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"폰-노이만-구조\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%8F%B0-%EB%85%B8%EC%9D%B4%EB%A7%8C-%EA%B5%AC%EC%A1%B0\" aria-label=\"폰 노이만 구조 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>폰 노이만 구조</h2>\n<h3 id=\"정의\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%A0%95%EC%9D%98\" aria-label=\"정의 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>정의</h3>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 720px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 56.111111111111114%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Von Neumann architecture\"\n        title=\"Von Neumann architecture\"\n        src=\"/static/37c3a54e78ede83609d415ad0883a791/37523/von_neumann.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/37c3a54e78ede83609d415ad0883a791/e9ff0/von_neumann.png 180w,\n/static/37c3a54e78ede83609d415ad0883a791/f21e7/von_neumann.png 360w,\n/static/37c3a54e78ede83609d415ad0883a791/37523/von_neumann.png 720w,\n/static/37c3a54e78ede83609d415ad0883a791/302a4/von_neumann.png 1080w,\n/static/37c3a54e78ede83609d415ad0883a791/21b4d/von_neumann.png 1280w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span></p>\n<p>오늘날의 컴퓨터는 대부분 <code class=\"language-text\">폰 노이만 구조</code>를 따른다. 폰 노이만 구조는 크게 <strong>CPU</strong> - <strong>Memory</strong> - <strong>Program</strong>로 구성된다. CPU와 메모리를 분히라여 명령어를 따로 저장하는 프로그램 내장 방식이다.<br>\n<br><br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"정의-1\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%A0%95%EC%9D%98-1\" aria-label=\"정의 1 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>정의</h3>\n<h3 id=\"code-classlanguage-text명령어-실행-사이클code\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#code-classlanguage-text%EB%AA%85%EB%A0%B9%EC%96%B4-%EC%8B%A4%ED%96%89-%EC%82%AC%EC%9D%B4%ED%81%B4code\" aria-label=\"code classlanguage text명령어 실행 사이클code permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a><strong><code class=\"language-text\">명령어 실행 사이클</code></strong></h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>명령어 가져오기 (IF, Instruction Fetch)</strong><br>\n: 기억장치로부터 명령어를 가져온다.</li>\n<li><strong>명령어 해석 (ID, Instruction Decode)</strong><br>\n: 앞서 가져온 명령어가 어떤 명령어인지 해석을 진행한다.</li>\n<li><strong>피연산자 인출(OF,Operands Fetch)</strong><br>\n: 명령의 실행에 필요한 정보를 기억장치에 접근해 가져온다.</li>\n<li><strong>명령어 실행 (EX, Instruction Execution)</strong><br>\n: 앞서 가져온 연산자와 데이터를 가지고 연산을 수행하고 저장한다.</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>인터럽트 체크</strong></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>👉🏻 <strong>작업을 수행하던 중 인터럽트가 발생했을 때의 처리과정</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>컴퓨터는 수행하던 일을 중지하고 현재 상태 (CPU 내부의 레지스터 값 등)를 보관한다.</li>\n<li>발생한 인터럽트를 처리하기 위해 인터럽트 서비스 루틴(ISR)을 수행한다.</li>\n<li>인터럽트가 처리되면 저장했던 이전 작업의 상태를 복구시켜 수행을 재개한다.</li>\n</ol>\n</blockquote>\n</li>\n</ol>","excerpt":"컴퓨터 구조 기초  폰 노이만 구조 정의  오늘날의 컴퓨터는 대부분 를 따른다. 폰 노이만 구조는 크게 CPU - Memory - Program로 구성된다. CPU와 메모리를 분히라여 명령어를 따로 저장하는 프로그램 내장 방식이다.  정의  명령어 가져오기 (IF, Instruction Fetch) : 기억장치로부터 명령어를 가져온다. 명령어 해석 (ID, Instruction Decode) : 앞서 가져온 명령어가 어떤 명령어인지 해석을 진행한다. 피연산자 인출(OF,Operands Fetch) : 명령의 실행에 필요한 정보를 기억장치에 접근해 가져온다. 명령어 실행 (EX, Instruction Execution) : 앞서 가져온 연산자와 데이터를 가지고 연산을 수행하고 저장한다. 인터럽트 체크 👉🏻 작업을 수행하던 중 인터럽트가 발생했을 때의 처리과정 컴퓨터는 수행하던 일을 중지하고 현재 상태 (CPU 내부의 레지스터 값 등)를 보관한다. 발생한 인터럽트를 처리하기 위해 인터럽…","frontmatter":{"date":"July 18, 2023","title":"[CS] 컴퓨터구조 - 컴퓨터 구조 기초","categories":"CS","author":"JSH99","emoji":"📚"},"fields":{"slug":"/CS/ComputerArchitecture/computer_architecture_basics/"}},"next":{"id":"c1c38fdd-e25d-5d0c-aa28-21d28eb3dca0","html":"<h1 id=\"컴퓨터의-구성\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%BB%B4%ED%93%A8%ED%84%B0%EC%9D%98-%EA%B5%AC%EC%84%B1\" aria-label=\"컴퓨터의 구성 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>컴퓨터의 구성</h1>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 720px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 49.44444444444444%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"computer configuration\"\n        title=\"computer configuration\"\n        src=\"/static/126044481891e55bfad9e3f3b2d8113d/37523/configuration.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/126044481891e55bfad9e3f3b2d8113d/e9ff0/configuration.png 180w,\n/static/126044481891e55bfad9e3f3b2d8113d/f21e7/configuration.png 360w,\n/static/126044481891e55bfad9e3f3b2d8113d/37523/configuration.png 720w,\n/static/126044481891e55bfad9e3f3b2d8113d/2c5fd/configuration.png 1006w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span><br>\n<br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"code-classlanguage-text하드웨어code--기계적-장치\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#code-classlanguage-text%ED%95%98%EB%93%9C%EC%9B%A8%EC%96%B4code--%EA%B8%B0%EA%B3%84%EC%A0%81-%EC%9E%A5%EC%B9%98\" aria-label=\"code classlanguage text하드웨어code  기계적 장치 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a><code class=\"language-text\">하드웨어</code> : 기계적 장치</h2>\n<h3 id=\"중앙처리장치cpu\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%A4%91%EC%95%99%EC%B2%98%EB%A6%AC%EC%9E%A5%EC%B9%98cpu\" aria-label=\"중앙처리장치cpu permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>중앙처리장치(CPU)</h3>\n<p>: 컴퓨터 시스템 전체를 제어하는 장치로서, 입력장치에서 데이터를 입력 받아 처리한 후 출력장치와 기억장치로 데이터를 전달</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">연산장치(ALU)</code>: 산술 연산(사칙연산)과 논리연산(참과 거짓 판단)을 수행하는 장치</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">제어장치</code>: CPU 내부에서 일어나는 모든 작업 통제 및 관리</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">레지스터</code>: 연산 중간 값, 명령어 등 일시적으로 저장하는 임시 기억 장치<br>\n<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"기억장치memory\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EA%B8%B0%EC%96%B5%EC%9E%A5%EC%B9%98memory\" aria-label=\"기억장치memory permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>기억장치(Memory)</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">주기억장치(내부 기억장치)</code>: 컴퓨터 시스템에서 수행되는 프로그램과 수행에 필요한 데이터를 기억하는 장치</p>\n<ul>\n<li>RAM</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">보조기억장치(외부 기억장치)</code>: 반영구적으로 데이터를 저장하고 보존할 수 있는 장치</p>\n<ul>\n<li>하드 디스크, 플로피 디스크, CD-ROM, DVD\n<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"입출력장치io\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%9E%85%EC%B6%9C%EB%A0%A5%EC%9E%A5%EC%B9%98io\" aria-label=\"입출력장치io permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>입출력장치(I/O)</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">입력장치</code>: 컴퓨터에서 처리할 데이터와 정보를 외부에서 입력해주는 역할</p>\n<ul>\n<li>마우스, 키보드, 마이크</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">출력장치</code>: 컴퓨터 내부에서 처리된 결과를 사용자에게 전달해주는 역할</p>\n<ul>\n<li>프린트, 스피커, 모니터\n<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"code-classlanguage-text소프트웨어code--하드웨어의-동작을-제시하고-지시하는-프로그램\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#code-classlanguage-text%EC%86%8C%ED%94%84%ED%8A%B8%EC%9B%A8%EC%96%B4code--%ED%95%98%EB%93%9C%EC%9B%A8%EC%96%B4%EC%9D%98-%EB%8F%99%EC%9E%91%EC%9D%84-%EC%A0%9C%EC%8B%9C%ED%95%98%EA%B3%A0-%EC%A7%80%EC%8B%9C%ED%95%98%EB%8A%94-%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EA%B7%B8%EB%9E%A8\" aria-label=\"code classlanguage text소프트웨어code  하드웨어의 동작을 제시하고 지시하는 프로그램 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a><code class=\"language-text\">소프트웨어</code> : 하드웨어의 동작을 제시하고 지시하는 프로그램</h2>\n<h3 id=\"시스템-소프트웨어\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%8B%9C%EC%8A%A4%ED%85%9C-%EC%86%8C%ED%94%84%ED%8A%B8%EC%9B%A8%EC%96%B4\" aria-label=\"시스템 소프트웨어 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>시스템 소프트웨어</h3>\n<p>: 사용자가 컴퓨터를 효율적으로 사용하기 위해 여러 컴퓨터 시스템에서 공통적으로 필요한 프로그램</p>\n<ul>\n<li>운영체제</li>\n<li>컴파일러\n<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"응용-소프트웨어\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%9D%91%EC%9A%A9-%EC%86%8C%ED%94%84%ED%8A%B8%EC%9B%A8%EC%96%B4\" aria-label=\"응용 소프트웨어 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>응용 소프트웨어</h3>\n<p>: 응용 분야에서 특정 목적을 위해 사용하는 프로그램</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Power Point → 발표 자료를 만들 때</li>\n<li>Chrome → 인터넷 검색을 할 때</li>\n</ul>","frontmatter":{"date":"July 18, 2023","title":"[CS] 컴퓨터구조 - 컴퓨터의 구성","categories":"CS","author":"JSH99","emoji":"📚"},"fields":{"slug":"/CS/ComputerArchitecture/computer_configuration/"}},"prev":{"id":"3b2c96f5-0b20-520d-8fb2-138be53a6ed7","html":"<h1 id=\"scss\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#scss\" aria-label=\"scss permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>SCSS</h1>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"정의\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%A0%95%EC%9D%98\" aria-label=\"정의 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>정의</h2>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 720px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 35.55555555555556%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"SCSS\"\n        title=\"SCSS\"\n        src=\"/static/eb407ec7b39040ed337b59a7c4838e1b/37523/scss.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/eb407ec7b39040ed337b59a7c4838e1b/e9ff0/scss.png 180w,\n/static/eb407ec7b39040ed337b59a7c4838e1b/f21e7/scss.png 360w,\n/static/eb407ec7b39040ed337b59a7c4838e1b/37523/scss.png 720w,\n/static/eb407ec7b39040ed337b59a7c4838e1b/442cb/scss.png 752w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span></p>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">SCSS</code>란 CSS pre-processor(전처리기)로서, 복잡한 작업을 쉽게 할 수 있게 해주고, 코드의 재활용성 및 가독성을 높여주어 유지보수를 쉽게 해준다.<br>\n<br><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"사용\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9\" aria-label=\"사용 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>사용</h2>\n<p><strong>중괄호</strong>와 <strong>세미콜론</strong>을 모두 사용한다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"scss\"><pre class=\"language-scss\"><code class=\"language-scss\"><span class=\"token selector\">.example </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">width</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 100px<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token selector\">li </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">color</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> blue<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"특징\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%8A%B9%EC%A7%95\" aria-label=\"특징 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>특징</h2>\n<h3 id=\"변수variable-할당\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EB%B3%80%EC%88%98variable-%ED%95%A0%EB%8B%B9\" aria-label=\"변수variable 할당 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>변수(Variable) 할당</h3>\n<p>자주 사용하는 속상 값을 변수로 지정하여 재사용할 수 있다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"scss\"><pre class=\"language-scss\"><code class=\"language-scss\"><span class=\"token property\"><span class=\"token variable\">$color</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> #ed5b46<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token selector\">div </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">background-color</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token variable\">$color</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"중첩nesting-구문\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%A4%91%EC%B2%A9nesting-%EA%B5%AC%EB%AC%B8\" aria-label=\"중첩nesting 구문 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>중첩(Nesting) 구문</h3>\n<p>중첩 구문을 사용해 가독성을 높일 수 있다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"scss\"><pre class=\"language-scss\"><code class=\"language-scss\"><span class=\"token selector\">nav </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token selector\">ul </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">margin</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 0<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">padding</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 0<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">list-style</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> none<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n  <span class=\"token selector\">li </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">display</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> inline-block<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n  <span class=\"token selector\">a </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">display</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> block<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">padding</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 6px 12px<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">text-decoration</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> none<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"모듈화modularity\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EB%AA%A8%EB%93%88%ED%99%94modularity\" aria-label=\"모듈화modularity permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>모듈화(Modularity)</h3>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">@use</code>를 사용하여 파일을 모듈화 할 수 있다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"scss\"><pre class=\"language-scss\"><code class=\"language-scss\"><span class=\"token comment\">/* _base.scss */</span>\n\n<span class=\"token property\"><span class=\"token variable\">$font-stack</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Helvetica<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> sans-serif<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token property\"><span class=\"token variable\">$primary-color</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> #333<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token selector\">body </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">font</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 100% <span class=\"token variable\">$font-stack</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">color</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token variable\">$primary-color</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"scss\"><pre class=\"language-scss\"><code class=\"language-scss\"><span class=\"token comment\">/* styles.scss */</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">@use</span> <span class=\"token string\">'base'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token selector\">.inverse </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">background-color</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> base.<span class=\"token variable\">$primary-color</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">color</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> white<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"믹스인mixins\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EB%AF%B9%EC%8A%A4%EC%9D%B8mixins\" aria-label=\"믹스인mixins permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>믹스인(Mixins)</h3>\n<p>함수처럼 default parameter를 지정할 수 있고, parameter를 받아 속성을 부여할 수 있다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"scss\"><pre class=\"language-scss\"><code class=\"language-scss\"><span class=\"token keyword\">@mixin</span> <span class=\"token function\">theme</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token property\"><span class=\"token variable\">$theme</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> DarkGray<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">background</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token variable\">$theme</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">box-shadow</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 0 0 1px <span class=\"token function\">rgba</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token variable\">$theme</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> 0.25<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">color</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> #fff<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token selector\">.info </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">@include</span> theme<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token selector\">.alert </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">@include</span> <span class=\"token function\">theme</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token property\"><span class=\"token variable\">$theme</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> DarkRed<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token selector\">.success </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">@include</span> <span class=\"token function\">theme</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token property\"><span class=\"token variable\">$theme</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> DarkGreen<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"확장--상속-extend--inheritance\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%99%95%EC%9E%A5--%EC%83%81%EC%86%8D-extend--inheritance\" aria-label=\"확장  상속 extend  inheritance permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>확장 / 상속 (Extend / Inheritance)</h3>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">@extend</code>를 사용하여 scss 속성 집합을 상속 받을 수 있다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"scss\"><pre class=\"language-scss\"><code class=\"language-scss\"><span class=\"token comment\">/* This CSS will print because %message-shared is extended. */</span>\n<span class=\"token selector\"><span class=\"token placeholder\">%message-shared</span> </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">border</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 1px solid #ccc<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">padding</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 10px<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">color</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> #333<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\">/* This CSS won't print because %equal-heights is never extended. */</span>\n<span class=\"token selector\"><span class=\"token placeholder\">%equal-heights</span> </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">display</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> flex<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">flex-wrap</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> wrap<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token selector\">.message </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">@extend</span> <span class=\"token placeholder selector\">%message-shared</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token selector\">.success </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">@extend</span> <span class=\"token placeholder selector\">%message-shared</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">border-color</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> green<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token selector\">.error </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">@extend</span> <span class=\"token placeholder selector\">%message-shared</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">border-color</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> red<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"연산자operators\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%97%B0%EC%82%B0%EC%9E%90operators\" aria-label=\"연산자operators permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>연산자(Operators)</h3>\n<p>div, random, max, min, sin, cos 등 여러 가지 수학적 기능을 사용할 수 있다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"scss\"><pre class=\"language-scss\"><code class=\"language-scss\"><span class=\"token selector\">article[role='main'] </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">width</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> math.<span class=\"token function\">div</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>600px<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> 960px<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> 100%<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token selector\">aside[role='complementary'] </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">width</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> math.<span class=\"token function\">div</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>300px<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> 960px<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> 100%<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">margin-left</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> auto<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"장점\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%9E%A5%EC%A0%90\" aria-label=\"장점 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>장점</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>선택자를 중첩하여 반복되는 부모 요소 사용 감소</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"단점\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EB%8B%A8%EC%A0%90\" aria-label=\"단점 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>단점</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>전처리기를 위한 도구 필요</li>\n<li>컴파일 시간 소요</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"scss--sass\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#scss--sass\" aria-label=\"scss  sass permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>SCSS 🆚 SASS</h2>\n<p><strong><code class=\"language-text\">SCSS</code></strong> : Sassy Cascading Style Sheets</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"scss\"><pre class=\"language-scss\"><code class=\"language-scss\"><span class=\"token selector\">a </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">color</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> yellow<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">background-color</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> black<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">border-radius</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 3px<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n  <span class=\"token selector\"><span class=\"token parent important\">&amp;</span>:hover </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">color</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> red<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<p><strong><code class=\"language-text\">SASS</code></strong> : Syntatically Awesome Style Sheets</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"sass\"><pre class=\"language-sass\"><code class=\"language-sass\"><span class=\"token selector\">a</span>\n<span class=\"token property-line\">  <span class=\"token property\">color</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> yellow</span>\n<span class=\"token property-line\">  <span class=\"token property\">background-color</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> black</span>\n<span class=\"token property-line\">  <span class=\"token property\">border-radius</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> 3px</span>\n\n<span class=\"token property-line\">  <span class=\"token property\">&amp;</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token property\">hover</span></span>\n<span class=\"token property-line\">    <span class=\"token property\">color</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> red</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>→ 중괄호와 세미콜론의 유무에 따라 사용 방식이 조금 다르지만, SCSS와 SASS는 서로 완벽하게 호환된다.<br>\n<br><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>references</strong><br>\n👉 <a href=\"https://sass-lang.com/documentation/\">https://sass-lang.com/documentation/</a><br>\n👉 <a href=\"https://cocoon1787.tistory.com/843\">https://cocoon1787.tistory.com/843</a></p>","frontmatter":{"date":"July 18, 2023","title":"[Web] CSS - SCSS","categories":"Web","author":"JSH99","emoji":"📚"},"fields":{"slug":"/Web/CSS/SCSS/"}},"site":{"siteMetadata":{"siteUrl":"https://www.jsh99.com","comments":{"utterances":{"repo":"JSH99/JSH99.github.io"}}}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/CS/ComputerArchitecture/computer_architecture_basics/","nextSlug":"/CS/ComputerArchitecture/computer_configuration/","prevSlug":"/Web/CSS/SCSS/"}},"staticQueryHashes":["1073350324","2938748437"]}